BEHAVIOR ceil

DESCRIPTION
  Smallest integer >= x (mathematical ceiling), returned as an int. Truncation
  (FTOI) rounds toward zero; for a positive x with a fractional part that is
  one too low, so add the correction. ceil(2.1)=3, ceil(-2.7)=-2.

CONTRACT
  INPUT x float 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH b6cfd5dd

IMPLEMENTATION
  xv = LOAD x 8
  t = FTOI xv 8 8
  tf = ITOF t 8 8
  lt = FLT tf xv 8
  r = IADD t lt 8
  STORE result r 8
END
